  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SBDP 2024-2028: Green growth, business enabling environment &amp; Jobs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFDK Capital Contribution for Somalia Green Growth Programme.

The Somalia Green Growth Programme&#x2019;s Objective is to increase private investment into commercial green growth investments. In turn, this will contribute to the objectives of Somalia&#x2019;s National Climate Policy and National Action Plan. In parallel, there is an aim of enabling development Finance Institutions (DFIs) and Impact Fund Denmark (IFDK) to be able to work in Somalia and other super-fragile states to contribute to the programme&apos;s objective.</narrative>
  </description>
